==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{hyphenation|car|ving|lang=en}}
* {{IPA|[ˈkɑɹvɪŋ]|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɑː(r)vɪŋ|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A carved object.
#: ''The '''carving''' on the oak panels was ancient.''
# The craft of producing a carved object.
#: ''He took up '''carving''' after his retirement.''

